+# Synthetic MMDB fixtures
+
+These are public MaxMind test fixtures, never production geography data.
+Source commit: `276926d23b4109ca5452709bfb5931c338afb34c` in
+[MaxMind-DB](https://github.com/maxmind/MaxMind-DB/tree/276926d23b4109ca5452709bfb5931c338afb34c).
+The accompanying MIT license is preserved unchanged.
+
+| Local file | Upstream path | SHA-256 |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| `city.mmdb` | `test-data/GeoLite2-City-Test.mmdb` | `f936702b51dcb6c94b286d77a6f182c31a1601baf4b27e8e896934deb41f49f2` |
+| `not-city.mmdb` | `test-data/MaxMind-DB-test-ipv6-24.mmdb` | `599f1555ce3a568c2d4ad965332dcba87d0d109297636f1b595241247263d98b` |
+
+City lookup expectations are from `source-data/GeoLite2-City-Test.json` at that
+commit: `2.125.160.216/29` is GB at `[51.75, -1.25]`, and `2001:218::/32` is JP
+at `[35.68536, 139.75309]`. The metadata build epoch is the fixture's published
+binary metadata, independently captured in the reader-comparison evidence.
+Handwritten provider-field cases specify the dashboard's missing-data contract.
